## 🔀 REGISTRO DE RUTAS (routes/web.php)

```php
// Login (ambos modos usan la misma ruta)
Volt::route('/', 'otp-login')
    ->middleware(['guest', 'throttle:10,1'])
    ->name('login');

// Dashboard (SOLO Admin Mode)
Volt::route('dashboard', 'unified-dashboard')
    ->middleware(['auth', 'session.timeout', 'simple.mode'])
    ->name('dashboard');

// Simple Unblock Form (SOLO Simple Mode)
Route::get('/simple-unblock', \App\Livewire\SimpleUnblockForm::class)
    ->middleware(['simple.mode.enabled', 'throttle.simple.unblock'])
    ->name('simple.unblock');
```

**⚠️ CRÍTICO**:
- Dashboard tiene middleware `simple.mode` → bloquea usuarios temporales
- Simple unblock tiene middleware `simple.mode.enabled` → retorna 404 si está desactivado

